  "quote": "A notice of termination need not be given if a landlord and a tenant have agreed to terminate a tenancy.",
  "reason": "Section 37 (3) explicitly permits ending a tenancy without a notice of termination when the landlord and tenant agree to terminate it, provided the agreement is made after the tenancy has begun."
